# Build-time configuration for `npm run build`. Committed on purpose: it holds no
# secret, only the public address of the deployed API, and `out/` is committed
# too (ADR-0019) — so if this value came from each person's shell, two people
# building the same commit would produce two different sites.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables are inlined into the JavaScript at build time, never
# read at run time. Changing this needs a rebuild, not a restart.
#
# To build against a backend somewhere else — a laptop, a branch deploy — put the
# override in `frontend/.env.production.local`, which is git-ignored. Do not edit
# this file for a local experiment; the diff in `out/` will follow you into the
# pull request.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://sasana-api.smkwikrama.sch.id
